sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Prometheus
  participant A as Alertmanager
  participant S as scheduler
  participant D as DVC pipeline
  participant G as promotion gate
  participant F as MLflow registry
  participant L as lstm-serve
  S->>P: /metrics: finsight_returns_drift_detected = 1 (≥ 30 % of stocks PSI > 0.25)
  P->>P: rule ReturnsDriftDetected holds for 5 min
  P->>A: alert (action = retrain)
  A->>S: POST /retrain (bearer token)
  alt within 24 h of the last retrain
    S-->>A: 200 ignored (cooldown)
  else a daily run is busy
    S-->>A: 202 queued, starts when the run ends
  else idle
    S-->>A: 202 run started
    S->>D: dvc repro (train_lstm → evaluate_lstm → register)
    D->>G: challenger metrics vs champion, same test windows
    alt challenger better and accepted (MAPE ≤ 1.02 × naive)
      G->>F: move @production to the new version
      F-->>L: alias moved → server restarts with the new model
    else not better
      G->>F: keep the current @production
    end
  end
